{"id":"sospechoso","lemma":"sospechoso","pos":"adj","rank":1018,"glosses":["suspicious, suspect, fishy, shady, sketchy","shifty"],"ipa":"/sospeˈt͡ʃoso/","forms":{"feminine":"sospechosa","masculinePlural":"sospechosos","femininePlural":"sospechosas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-sospechoso.wav","examples":[{"text":"Eso parece sospechoso.","en":"That seems suspicious.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461255","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ése"},{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},null]},{"text":"¿La policía tiene algún sospechoso?","en":"Do the police have any suspects?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608535","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"Civility"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,null]},{"text":"Esto parece sospechoso, ¿no crees?","en":"This seems a bit suspicious, don't you think?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/823858","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"}]},{"text":"Creo que todos somos sospechosos.","en":"I think we're all suspects.","words":[{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Eres un sospechoso.","en":"You're a suspect.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443990","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}